      "purpose": "A utility/library module (DLLUTILV20) providing a collection of low-level helper procedures for IBM i ILE RPG applications. It defines prototypes and implementations for: memory operations (MemCpy via _MEMMOVE, MemSet via __memset, AllocateAuto via _MODASA), binary search (wrapping C bsearch), Base64 and ASCII/EBCDIC conversion, MD5 hashing, cipher (_CIPHER), a ProcedureIndex data structure with create/delete/add/retrieve/link operations, signature checking, template naming, exception handling (Throw/Catch), and miscellaneous utilities. Uses /COPY to pull in additional prototypes from RAYLIB library. Appears to be part of a versioned DLL-style framework (V20) for dynamic procedure dispatch on IBM i.",
